# Source: https://github.com/dhbloo/rapfi/archive/1387d11312190ec66665d361ff07a7c70221b78a.tar.gz
# Native CMake source is Rapfi/, not the repository root; no submodules needed.
# Release, haswell (SSE + AVX2 + BMI2), static link; command modules stay enabled.
# See scripts/engine-assets.sh RAPFI_CMAKE_FLAGS and docs/gomoku-analysis.md.
#
# Networks: Rapfi Networks submodule commit
# 7eeb19b55219a48138756293f92211a1539bab4d, CC0-1.0 (redistribution allowed).
# The web net.json pins an Emscripten .data container, NOT a native network.
# scripts/rapfi-assets.mjs pins its SHA256, byte ranges, every extracted native
# model/config SHA256, and licence texts. Freestyle uses
# mix9svqfreestyle_bsmix.bin.lz4, SHA256
# 6bc0d1b0ff8e1d857f7f412923cd458f38f1a435087c91ae71fec3676c23ef62.
# The original config also names standard/renju weights and model210901.bin;
# all bundled files are pinned and shipped to preserve that config unchanged.
# Config origin: config-example/gomocalc-mix9svq at the code pin above.
# Never replace one input with an unpinned "latest" network.
#
# This pin supplies native analysis assets only; it opens no Gomoku surface,
# changes no ratings, and does not authorize an engine-worker deployment.
